 "pin_regs": {
  "enable": false,
  "reason": "ring-stop control root split from ring_v5: ring link inputs cw_i/ccw_i are captured at the pin (pin[]), every ring / publish / lane-face output is a flop Q except carry_write (rx_slot AND pin-flop field, the closed state-capture lanes capture it at their own pin); compiler control inputs are evaluated in their reserved capture edge (bench-proven ring_v5 contract, AG=0 identical). Automatic +1 pin registers would shift the ctl <-> closed state-lane read loop (READ_LEAD 2) and break the lane alignment"
 },
